                <characteristic name="Ability" typeId="3467-0678-083e-eb50">At the end of the Select Operatives step, if this operative is selected for deployment, select up to two of the following improvements or weapon rules for this weapon to have for the battle: Add 1 to the Normal Dmg stat, add 1 to the Critical Dmg stat, Balanced, Brutal, Lethal 5+, Rending.</characteristic>
