          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Ability" typeId="3467-0678-083e-eb50">Whenever an enemy operative is within 3&quot; of this operative, your opponent must spend 1 additional AP for that enemy operative to perform the **Pick Up Marker** and mission actions. Whenever determining control of a marker, treat the total APL stat of enemy operatives that contest it as 1 lower if at least one of those enemy operatives is within 3&quot; of this operative. Note this isn’t a change to the APL stat, so any changes are cumulative with this.</characteristic>
